cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the trained networks, please cite the paper and this repository."
type: software
title: "Adaptive PINNs for elastic wave propagation in heterogeneous media: code and trained networks"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-23"
license:
  - MIT
  - CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/hannanmustajab/elastodynamics-pinn"
abstract: >-
  Training scripts, network definitions, SOAP optimizer, training logs and trained networks of the 24 runs of the
  paper "Adaptive Physics-Informed Neural Networks (PINNs) for Elastic Wave Propagation in Heterogeneous Media",
  with the scripts that compute the DEVITO reference solutions, score the networks and draw the figures.
keywords:
  - physics-informed neural networks
  - elastic wave propagation
  - PirateNet
  - SOAP optimizer
  - residual-based adaptive sampling
  - Marmousi2
